[l_english.STATE_LORE_504]
Nearly a hundred years ago, the ancestors of the Apple family settled on this land. The two princesses promised them that if they could cultivate this barren land and repel the vines that ravaged from the Everfree Forest, then their descendants would forever own this land. As the hardworking Apple family succeeded, more and more ponies came here, some looking for opportunities to get rich, and some just out of necessity of survival. In short, the early Ponyville was born. Soon, the expanding number of settlers made it the largest agricultural town in Equestria.
After the end of the Ultimate Battle, the Big Three’s first idea was to controll Ponyvile, then control the surrounding area, to ensure that the main settlement and agricultural land of Equestria were under their control. They did not trust the original mayor Mare, so they promoted Trixie to the temporary head of security — though Queen Chrysalis was very dissatisfied with this appointment and strongly opposed it, Cozy Glow and Tirek seemed to have no deep hatred for this pony. Two votes to one, Trixie embarked on a tortuous path of ascent. With the occurrence of the “Ghost Train” accident, Mare was dismissed, Trixie became the mayor, and then, riding the tide of the Empire’s feudal reform, she became the district head, regional governor, and then the elected Duchess of Ponyville, which became the Duchy of Ponyville. Under Trixie’s protection, the Duchy of Ponyville managed to escape most of the Empress’s tyranny, becoming one of the few areas in the central continent of Equestria that was free from famine and riots, and managed to maintain economic growth. However, winter is coming, how long can this prosperity last?

[l_simp_chinese.STATE_LORE_504]
近百年前，苹果家族的祖先在这片土地上居住下来。两公主许诺他们，如果他们可以开垦这片荒芜的土地，击退来自无尽之森肆虐的藤蔓，那么他们的后代将永远拥有这片土地。随着勤劳的苹果家族取得成功，越来越多的小马来到这里，有的在寻找暴富的机遇，有的则只是生计所迫。总之，早期的小马谷就这样诞生了。很快，膨胀的定居者数量让这里成为了小马利亚最大的农业小镇。
终末之战结束后，三巨头首先想到的也是小马谷：他们希望控制这里，进而控制小马谷周边，从而保证整个小马利亚的主要聚居地和农业产地都在他们的掌控之中。他们并不信赖原有的镇长梅耶，因此提拔了特丽克西为临时安保队长 —— 虽然邪茧女王对这项任命非常不满而坚决反对，但和煦光流与提雷克似乎都对这只小马没什么深刻的仇恨，两票对一票，特丽克西就走上了曲折的上升之路。随着“幽灵列车”事故发生，梅耶被免职，特丽克西成为镇长，随后乘着帝国分封制改革的风潮，她又成为了小马谷大区区长、地区总督、以及民选公爵，小马谷也成为了公爵领。在特丽克西的庇护下， 小马谷公爵领得以躲过了和煦光流的大部分暴政，成为小马利亚中央大陆上为数不多免于饥荒和暴乱的地区，并难能可贵地保持了经济正增长。然而，凛冬将至，这种繁荣又能持续多久呢？
